# Measurement layout, not a verdict: East times every headless suite serially on one prep tree while
# West runs the other seven checks, so each suite's cost is known before shards are drawn.
# host lane kind [args]
east prep prep
east cal calibrate
west prep prep
west ct cargo-test
west ctr cargo-test --release
west qml qmllint-gate
west budget file-budget
west proto protocol
